{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "72859a50-6acc-83ce-9849-8ef87063f034",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T13:31:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Timothy Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about my recycling. It got left at the curb with a tag on it saying it was rejected. [pause] Sorry, hang on, I've got my hands full here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time. A tag on the bin, saying it was rejected. Is that what you're telling me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Orange tag, I think, stuck on the lid. Bin's still full, nobody took it. And I didn't put anything weird in there, it's just, you know, the regular stuff. Cardboard, cans, [inaudible] the bottles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the address where the bin was left?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "400 Rhode Island Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four hundred Rhode Island Avenue. And that's today, Monday, that it was picked up, or tried to be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, no, it was this morning, yeah. Monday. I came out about, I don't know, eleven, and there's the tag. Did you hear that? Sorry, I'm moving some cables around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear a little rustling, that's all right. Did the tag say why it was rejected? Sometimes there's a box checked off or a note written on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a checkbox thing. I can't really read it, the ink ran a little. Something about contamination maybe. I don't know what they think was contaminated. I rinse everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so possibly a contamination note, but hard to read. I'll put that down. Do you want me to explain what usually gets a bin tagged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:46-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not really, no. I mean I know the rules. What I want is for somebody, a supervisor, to call me back and look at it. Because the bin is still sitting there full and I'd like it picked up or at least told what was wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:30:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. You'd like a supervisor to call you back about the rejected bin at 400 Rhode Island Avenue. What's the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0164. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-four. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:30:20-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. And, uh, timing matters a little. I work from home, remote, and I've got a video meeting starting in ten minutes. So I'm going to be on that for a while. Can they try later this afternoon, or leave a message if I don't pick up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that you're on a video call for the next while and that a voicemail is fine. I can't promise exactly when the supervisor will get to it, but I'll mark it as a callback request today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:30:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Just, if they can say whether the bin's getting picked up, that'd be good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the notes too. So, to read it back: rejected recycling bin with a tag, left at the curb this morning at 400 Rhode Island Avenue, supervisor to call 401-555-0164, voicemail okay, you're in a meeting for a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's everything. Okay, I gotta go get my laptop up. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Good luck with your meeting. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye."
    }
  ],
